{
  "html": [
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "The early Christian basilica established the fundamental plan that would define sacred architecture for centuries."
        },
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fnref:1"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "sup",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "#fn:1"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "1"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Its most distinctive feature is the longitudinal axis, oriented toward the east, where the altar stands beneath a semicircular apse."
        },
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fnref:2"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "sup",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "#fn:2"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "2"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " The colonnaded nave, flanked by lower aisles on either side, created a processional space of great solemnity."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "The mosaics that once covered every surface have largely perished, yet enough fragments remain to suggest their original splendour."
        },
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fnref:3"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "sup",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "#fn:3"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "3"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " The symbolic programme was systematic: the apse reserved for Christ in majesty, the nave walls devoted to scriptural narrative."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Later modifications have altered nearly every example, yet the essential structure endures, recognisable beneath centuries of accretion."
        },
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fnref:4"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "sup",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "#fn:4"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "4"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "ol",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fn:1"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "For a full account of the form and symbolical meaning of the Basilica, see "
            },
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "em",
              "attributes": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "Christian Art"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": ", vol. i. p. 12."
            },
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "#fnref:1"
                ],
                [
                  "title",
                  "return to article"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "↩"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fn:2"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "The measures are given in the appendix. The orientation was not invariably to the east; examples exist facing north and west."
            },
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "#fnref:2"
                ],
                [
                  "title",
                  "return to article"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "↩"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fn:3"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "A sketch of the surviving apse mosaic has been published in the folio work on Byzantine ornament."
            },
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "#fnref:3"
                ],
                [
                  "title",
                  "return to article"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "↩"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "anchor",
          "id": "fn:4"
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "li",
          "attributes": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Historical Essay on Architecture (third edition), chap. ix. p. 95."
            },
            {
              "kind": "element",
              "name": "a",
              "attributes": [
                [
                  "href",
                  "#fnref:4"
                ],
                [
                  "title",
                  "return to article"
                ]
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "↩"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
